@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Health Path";
}

<main class="health-path">

    <!-- =====================================================
         CHAPTER ONE — THE WELCOME
         ===================================================== -->
    <section class="health-chapter health-chapter-one">

        <div class="health-chapter__inner">

            <header class="health-chapter__header">
                <p class="health-chapter__eyebrow">
                    Health Path
                </p>

                <h1 class="health-chapter__title">
                    Whatever brought you here today...
                    <span>we understand.</span>
                </h1>

                <p class="health-chapter__opening">
                    Because we've all been there.
                </p>
            </header>


            <!-- The visitor begins to recognize themselves -->
            <div class="health-chapter__passage health-chapter__passage--arrival">

                <p>
                    At some point in life...
                </p>

                <p>
                    Most of us know what it feels like to become invisible.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Not invisible to the eye...
                </p>

                <p>
                    Invisible inside.
                </p>

                <p>
                    We smile.
                </p>

                <p>
                    We tell people we're doing okay.
                </p>

                <p>
                    We keep putting one foot in front of the other.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Yet quietly, somewhere deep inside, we wonder...
                </p>

                <blockquote class="health-chapter__question">
                    “Is there anybody out there?”
                </blockquote>

                <p>
                    Maybe your health has become a daily struggle.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Maybe stress has quietly worn you down.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Maybe life has simply become heavier than you ever imagined.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Whatever brought you here today...
                </p>

                <p class="health-chapter__emphasis">
                    We see you.
                </p>

                <p>
                    And we're genuinely glad you're here.
                </p>

            </div>


            <!-- The front door opens -->
            <div class="health-chapter__welcome">

                <p>
                    Before we talk about health...
                </p>

                <p>
                    Before we talk about products...
                </p>

                <p>
                    Before we talk about anything else...
                </p>

                <p>
                    We'd simply like to invite you in.
                </p>

                <div class="health-chapter__invitation">
                    <p>Pull up a chair.</p>

                    <p>Take a deep breath.</p>

                    <p>Stay awhile.</p>
                </div>

                <p class="health-chapter__promise">
                    You don't have to carry it alone while you're here.
                </p>

            </div>


            <!-- Seen, valued, and understood -->
            <div class="health-chapter__passage">

                <p>
                    Health is deeply personal.
                </p>

                <p>
                    So is hope.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Neither begins with perfect answers.
                </p>

                <p>
                    They begin when someone finally feels seen.
                </p>

                <p>
                    When someone realizes they matter.
                </p>

                <p>
                    When someone discovers they are no longer walking alone.
                </p>

                <p class="health-chapter__emphasis">
                    That's where every meaningful journey begins.
                </p>

            </div>


            <!-- Hope enters -->
            <div class="health-chapter__passage health-chapter__passage--hope">

                <p>
                    We believe better health can change lives.
                </p>

                <p>
                    We've seen it.
                </p>

                <p>
                    We've experienced it.
                </p>

                <p>
                    But we've learned something just as important.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Sometimes the first step toward healing isn't physical.
                </p>

                <p class="health-chapter__emphasis">
                    Sometimes...
                </p>

                <p class="health-chapter__hope-line">
                    The first step is hope.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Hope that tomorrow can be better than today.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Hope that someone understands.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Hope that life still has beautiful chapters waiting to be written.
                </p>

            </div>


            <!-- Why Health Path exists -->
            <div class="health-chapter__passage">

                <p class="health-chapter__emphasis">
                    This is why Health Path exists.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Not to pressure you.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Not to convince you.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Not to rush you.
                </p>

                <p>
                    But to walk beside you.
                </p>

                <div class="health-chapter__rhythm">
                    <p>One conversation.</p>

                    <p>One step.</p>

                    <p>One day at a time.</p>
                </div>

            </div>


            <!-- The measure of success -->
            <div class="health-chapter__passage health-chapter__passage--closing">

                <p>
                    If, after spending a little time here...
                </p>

                <p>
                    You leave feeling just a little lighter...
                </p>

                <p>
                    A little more hopeful...
                </p>

                <p>
                    A little more seen...
                </p>

                <p class="health-chapter__emphasis">
                    Then today has already been worthwhile.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Whether you become a customer...
                </p>

                <p>
                    Whether you become a partner...
                </p>

                <p>
                    Or whether today simply reminds you that your story still matters...
                </p>

                <p>
                    We're grateful you stopped by.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Because every person who walks through this door matters.
                </p>

                <p class="health-chapter__final-truth">
                    Including you.
                </p>

            </div>


            <!-- Continue only when the visitor is ready -->
            <footer class="health-chapter__footer">

                <p>
                    When you're ready...
                </p>

                <a asp-controller="Home"
                   asp-action="NextChapter"
                   class="health-chapter__next">
                    Let's take the next step
                    <span>Together.</span>
                </a>

            </footer>

        </div>

    </section>






    <!-- =========================================================
     Chapter One Closing
     ========================================================= -->

    <section class="gw-chapter-closing">

        <p>Thank you...</p>

        <p>
            Thank you for spending a little time with us today.
        </p>

        <p>
            We hope that while you were here...
        </p>

        <p class="gw-emphasis">
            ...you began to remember just how valuable you are.
        </p>

        <p>
            You don't have to have everything figured out today.
        </p>

        <p>
            Sometimes...
        </p>

        <p>
            Hope begins with one small step.
        </p>

        <p>
            Whenever you're ready...
        </p>

        <p>
            We'd be honored to take that next step with you.
        </p>

    </section>

    <div class="gw-next-room">

        <a asp-controller="Home"
           asp-action="NextChapter"
           class="gw-next-button">
            Continue Your Journey →
        </a>

    </div>

</main>
